sequenceDiagram
  participant G as radosgw
  participant I as index shard .dir.M.7
  participant D as data pool
  G->>I: cls rgw.bucket_prepare_op(ADD, key, tag)
  I-->>G: ok · pending_map gets tag
  G->>D: write head + tails
  D-->>G: ok · head version
  G->>I: cls rgw.bucket_complete_op(ADD, tag, ver, meta)
  I->>I: drop tag · update entry and stats · append bilog
  Note over G,I: crash before complete → stale tag older than 120 s
  G->>D: listing: check_disk_state(head)
  G->>I: cls rgw.dir_suggest_changes(UPDATE or REMOVE)
